! WATCH.DBG - watchpoints (docs/PHASE-42.md, subtask 1): a longword, a
! byte, and a 16-byte area, each written by a different instruction
! (MOVL, ADDL2, INCL in a JSB subroutine, MOVB, MOVC3), a temporary
! watchpoint, a DEPOSIT to a watched location, and how SET, SHOW, and
! CANCEL WATCH word things.
!
SHOW WATCH
SET WATCH WATCHL
SET WATCH WATCHB
SET WATCH BUFFER
SET WATCH/TEMPORARY RESULT
SHOW WATCH
!
! RESULT (temporary), then WATCHL by ADDL2.
GO
SHOW WATCH
GO
SHOW CALLS
!
! A DEPOSIT doesn't trigger a watchpoint.
DEPOSIT WATCHL = 5
EXAMINE WATCHL
!
! WATCHB by MOVB, BUFFER by MOVC3, WATCHL by BUMP's INCL.
GO
GO
EXAMINE/ASCII:16 BUFFER
GO
SHOW CALLS
!
CANCEL WATCH WATCHL
SHOW WATCH
CANCEL WATCH/ALL
SHOW WATCH
GO
